From 43b81a989650398c4971456562488bed8a00783a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roland Vizner <148648143+rolandVi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Sep 2025 11:41:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [Blazor] Generalize the Image component and add new
 components for Video and FileDownload

Introduces a suite of media components for efficiently handling non-HTTP sources (byte[]s or streams) with streaming through JS interop and browser-side caching. The suite includes Image, Video, and FileDownload which built on a shared foundation.
